! 2007-12-03 - Gloria CORTI
 - Use names of volumes as in DC06 geometry.
 - First version of the package copying DTD and Visualization directory from
   XmlDDDB v30r4.

   To use it give as file for the visualization $XMLVISROOT/xml/colors.xml, 
   for example for Panoramix you should do:

     VisualizationSvc.ColorDbLocation = "$XMLVISROOT/xml/colors.xml

 - Modify visualization for beam pipe materials and supports
